# Data-table / DSL scoped edit

## Config-only changes
Edit `private-config/**/*.settings.ts` and the relevant fragment under `cabinet-constructor/types/`. Do **not** open `DataTable.tsx` / `DataTableFormDialog.tsx`.

## Column / filter DSL behavior
Prefer `utils/column-dsl-*.ts`, `utils/dslToolbarFilter.ts`, `functions/column-factories/`, then a partial read of `generateColumns` — never the full file.

## Collection-specific UI
Add or edit `data-table/plugins/<collection>/`. Do not add `if (collection === …)` to `DataTable.tsx`.

## Imports
Use path imports (`…/data-table/RelationSelect`) — not the package barrel except `LazyDataTable` / shared types.

## God files
Never load entire `DataTable.tsx`, `DataTableFormDialog.tsx`, `useDataTableFormCallbacks.ts`, or `useDataTableFetchCallbacks.ts`. Grep first; Read with offset/limit.
